Route45_Text_HikerErikIntro::
	.string "Be prepared for anything!\p"
	.string "Let me see if your POKéMON have been\n"
	.string "raised properly!$"

Route45_Text_HikerErikDefeat::
	.string "Oh, I lost that!$"

Route45_Text_HikerErik::
	.string "I’ll head back to BLACKTHORN’s ICE\n"
	.string "PATH and train some more.$"

Route45_Text_CooltrainerRyanIntro::
	.string "What are your thoughts on\n"
	.string "raising POKéMON?$"

Route45_Text_CooltrainerRyanDefeat::
	.string "You’ve won my respect.$"

Route45_Text_CooltrainerRyan::
	.string "I see you’re raising your POKéMON\n"
	.string "with care.\p"
	.string "The bond you build will save you in\n"
	.string "tough situations.$"

Route45_Text_Hiker172Intro::
	.string "My POKéMON are power packed!$"

Route45_Text_Hiker172Defeat::
	.string "Wahahah! I’m the big loser!$"

Route45_Text_Hiker172::
	.string "I’m not much good at thinking, see?\p"
	.string "So, I just plow ahead with power!$"

Route45_Text_CooltrainerKellyIntro::
	.string "What is your battle strategy?\p"
	.string "It is foolish to use strong moves\n"
	.string "indiscriminately.$"

Route45_Text_CooltrainerKellyDefeat::
	.string "Fine. I lost.$"

Route45_Text_CooltrainerKelly::
	.string "I’m not in favor of overly powerful\n"
	.string "moves.\p"
	.string "I want to win, but I also don’t want\n"
	.string "to harm POKéMON.$"

Route45_Text_BlackBelt316Intro::
	.string "I was training here alone.\p"
	.string "Behold the fruits of my labor!$"

Route45_Text_BlackBelt316Defeat::
	.string "Waaaargh!$"

Route45_Text_BlackBelt316::
	.string "This calls for extreme measures.\p"
	.string "I must take to the hills and train in\n"
	.string "solitude.$"

Route45_Text_HikerTimothyIntro::
	.string "Why do I climb mountains?\p"
	.string "Because they’re there.\p"
	.string "Why do I train POKéMON?\p"
	.string "Because they’re there!$"

Route45_Text_HikerTimothyDefeat::
	.string "Losses...\n"
	.string "They’re there too!$"

Route45_Text_HikerTimothy::
	.string "The best thing to ever happen to me\n"
	.string "was discovering POKéMON.$"

Route45_Text_HikerMichaelIntro::
	.string "Yo! You’re spunky!\n"
	.string "But you know what?\p"
	.string "When it comes to sheer spunkiness,\n"
	.string "I’m the man!$"

Route45_Text_HikerMichaelDefeat::
	.string "My POKéMON weren’t spunky enough!$"

Route45_Text_HikerMichael::
	.string "Boy, do I love HP UP! Mmmm, yum!\p"
	.string "I keep drinking my POKéMON’s!\n"
	.string "I can’t help it!$"

Route45_Text_Sign1::
	.string "ROUTE 45\n"
	.string "MOUNTAIN RD.AHEAD$"
